    title: "Pinnacle World School, Kangra — CBSE Website · Divyansh Sood",
    description: "CBSE school website for Pinnacle World School, Baroh (Kangra): Mandatory Public Disclosure, admissions over WhatsApp, and no fact without a source.",
    ogTitle: "Pinnacle World School — CBSE school website · Case study",
