    title: "Himalayan Brothers Travel — Tours & Taxi Website · Divyansh Sood",
    description: "A Dharamshala hotel family's travel desk: 15 tours, 8 taxi routes and 20 experiences on 51 pages, on the hotel site's design system, with WhatsApp enquiries.",
    ogTitle: "Himalayan Brothers — tours, taxis & treks · Case study",
    ogDescription: "A hotel family's travel desk, from parked domain to 51 pages on a shared design system.",
