    line: "A Manali travel agency's website from 2011, rebuilt from 96 crawled versions into 77 pages — every old URL accounted for, every unconfirmed fact marked on the page.",
    brief: "Leisure Himachal sells Himachal and Leh-Ladakh packages from Manali. Its hand-built site had run since 2011, quoted three different prices for most packages, and a search for the business's own name found nothing.",
    build: ["12 packages, 9 destinations, 7 taxi routes, 24 guides","71 redirect rules from the old site and the Wayback Machine","Unconfirmed facts outlined on the page with #review","Lighthouse 95+ on mobile, or the release fails"],
