    brief: "Manish Kumar runs a Swift Dzire and an Innova Crysta from beside Kangra Airport at Gaggal: airport and station pickups, temple yatras and Himachal tours. The design mockup looked good, and it was full of numbers nobody had given.",
    build: ["20 packages, 17 taxi routes, a 14-temple guide and 5 posts","Fake stats, reviews and urgency badges banned by the build","One prices file feeds cards, FAQs, schema and llms.txt","63 places linked to the right Wikipedia and Wikidata entries"],
    stats: [["54","Indexable pages"],["63","Places verified on Wikidata"],["95–100","Lighthouse mobile, 9 page types"]],
